# Normalize all text to LF in the repository.
#
# Without this, working on Windows rewrites every file's line endings and git
# reports whole-file changes: on 2026-08-16 the working tree showed 46 files
# "modified" with 14,506 insertions and 14,506 deletions - identical counts,
# because nothing had actually changed. Run `git add --renormalize .` once
# after restoring this file to clear that noise.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.task binary
*.wasm binary
*.pdf binary

*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
